Hash without Sine (ditherHash in main.metal)
--------------------------------------------
The dither's hash function is hash12 from David Hoskins' "Hash without Sine"
(https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4djSRW), with the same constants. The original
project's file does not name him; his notice is restored here:

Copyright (c)2014 David Hoskins.

